            "created_at": 1689676177,
            "pk": "17877798998862410",
            "text": "Join us for a Live Session on Thursday, July 20th, at 5 PM on Instagram! We are thrilled to have Ali Lazim, CEO and founder of Medixbot, sharing his remarkable experience participating in the prestigious Hero Training Program by Astana Hub and Draper University.\n\nDuring this live session, Ali will delve into the journey of Medixbot, a groundbreaking comprehensive continuous monitoring and management system for Diabetes Type-1 and Type-2. This innovative solution encompasses five main components: continuous glucose monitoring, continuous blood monitoring, automated insulin delivery, embedded AI, and a mobile app for personalized multi-dimensional metabolic healthcare.\n\nDon't miss out on the opportunity to hear firsthand about the challenges, triumphs, and lessons learned from Ali's participation in the Hero Training Program. Gain insights into the transformative power of this acceleration program.\n\nSee you at the live session on Thursday, July 20th, at 5 PM! And remember, the deadline to apply for the second batch of the Hero Training Program is August 6th.\n\nTo submit your application for the program, please visit our taplink!"
